LAYOUT:
Four views of the same empty place, arranged in a 2x2 grid of equal panels:
top-left: standing at the entrance, looking into the place.
top-right: standing at the far end, looking back toward the entrance.
bottom-left: looking straight at the left side (as seen from the entrance).
bottom-right: looking straight at the right side (as seen from the entrance).
No people anywhere. Even, neutral daylight in every panel.
All four panels must clearly be the same place: identical layout, furniture, materials and colors.
Count the furniture: the number of tables, chairs and rows is the same in every panel where they are visible.
No text, labels, captions, arrows or borders with writing.

